  "validation_rules": [
    "A hen cannot be split for a Z-linked recessive mutation.",
    "A Z-linked male may be normal, split, or visual depending on his two Z alleles.",
    "Two alleles from the same autosomal locus cannot be stored as independent mutation booleans.",
    "Two alleles from the ino locus cannot be stored as independent TCB and Ino genes.",
    "Lacewing must be represented as Cinnamon + Ino with phase information, not as an independent locus.",
    "A visible phenotype does not prove that other loci are genetically absent.",
    "Masking must never delete genotype information.",
    "Phenotype aggregation must not merge offspring with different hidden genotypes unless the UI explicitly labels them as genetically distinct.",
    "Rare or historically disputed mutations must carry a confidence/status field and be switchable in the engine."
  ],
